   $q$What is the purpose of the paragraph in which Teodora remembers the rule "never become attached"?$q$, $q$[{"text":"It shows that she is bored by the letters and wants to go home on time.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"reverses-meaning"},{"text":"It reveals that she already knows the letters belong to her own family.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-sequence"},{"text":"It explains that she plans to stop reading and return the box to the estate sale.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"It raises tension by showing her professional distance starting to slip as the letters affect her.","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$It raises tension by showing her professional distance starting to slip as the letters affect her.$q$, $q$She recalls the rule and then, "But she kept reading," showing her feelings overriding her training. She does not know the family connection until the photograph.$q$, 'draft', 'ed175c7e-8e4b-554a-986e-8657ca6d97cf')
